body.zh:
因式分解 (Factorization) 就是把一個多項式寫成「幾個因式相乘」的形態。面對任何因式分解題目，第一步永遠是先觀察各項有沒有公因式 (Common Factor) 可以提取。
例如：$6r^{2}+4rs$ 的兩項都含有 $2r$，提取之後括號內剩下 $3r+2s$：{{math:0}}
完成提取後必須養成檢查習慣：把結果展開 (Expansion)，能夠完全回到原式才算正確：{{math:1}}

body.en:
Factorization means writing a polynomial as a product of factors. For any factorisation question, the first step is always to look for a common factor in every term.
For example, both terms of $6r^{2}+4rs$ contain $2r$, so taking it out leaves $3r+2s$ inside the bracket: {{math:0}}
After taking out the common factor, make a habit of checking by expanding the result — it must give back the original expression: {{math:1}}

body.zh:
四項而又沒有全部共同的公因式時，用 grouping（併項分組）：把四項分成兩組，每組各自抽公因式，然後兩組會出現相同的括號，再把那括號抽走。
例：$hk+1+h+k$，先把項調位再分組：{{math:0}}
重點提示一：後兩項抽不出字母時，其實是抽出了 $+1$；把括號抽走後，該位置會留下 $+1$，不是消失。
重點提示二：分組後兩個括號必須一模一樣。若只差一個負號，抽 $-1$ 出來就一樣了：{{math:1}}

body.en:
When there are four terms and no factor common to all of them, use grouping: split the four terms into two pairs, take out the common factor of each pair, and the same bracket should then appear in both pairs — take that bracket out.
Example: $hk+1+h+k$ — rearrange the terms first, then group: {{math:0}}
Note 1: when the last two terms share no letter, you are in fact taking out $+1$; that $+1$ stays inside the bracket, it does not disappear.
Note 2: the two brackets must be identical. If they differ only by a minus sign, take out $-1$ and they match: {{math:1}}

body.zh:
三條恆等式要背熟，看見就直接用：
平方差{{math:0}}
完全平方（和）{{math:1}}
完全平方（差）{{math:2}}
判斷方法：兩項而且「平方減平方」→ 平方差；三項時看首尾是否平方、中間是否等於 $2ab$ → 完全平方。

body.en:
Learn the three identities by heart and use them on sight:
Difference of two squares{{math:0}}
Perfect square (sum){{math:1}}
Perfect square (difference){{math:2}}
How to decide: two terms with “square minus square” → difference of two squares; three terms → check whether the first and last are squares and the middle equals $2ab$ → perfect square.

body.zh:
$ax^{2}+bx+c$ 這種三項式 (Trinomial) 若不符合完全平方恆等式，則需使用十字相乘法 (Cross-method)：把首項係數 (Coefficient) 與常數項 (Constant Term) 各拆成兩個因式並排成十字，交叉相乘後相加，總和必須完全吻合中間項。
例如 $x^{2}-5x+6$：$(-2)+(-3)=-5$ 正好吻合中間項，所以{{math:0}}
當二次項係數 $a \neq 1$ 時，需要嘗試多種因數組合：{{math:1}}

body.en:
If the trinomial $ax^{2}+bx+c$ does not fit a perfect-square identity, use the cross-method: split the coefficient of $x^{2}$ and the constant term into factors, arrange them in a cross, multiply across and add — the sum must match the middle term exactly.
For example $x^{2}-5x+6$: the middle term matches because $(-2)+(-3)=-5$, so{{math:0}}
When the coefficient of $x^{2}$ is not 1 you may have to try several factor combinations: {{math:1}}

body.zh:
卷二（MC）不需要長題的完整步驟 —— 但也不需要由頭展開到尾。
很多因式分解 MC，看「尾巴那一兩項」的符號就可以先刪去一半選項：尾巴 $+m-n$ 就是 $+(m-n)$，所以答案的兩個括號之中，一定有一個是 $(m-n)$ —— 其他選項即刻可以刪。
例：$4m^{2}-7mn+3n^{2}+m-n$：{{math:0}}
刪完之後仍要驗算一次（把答案展開，看能否完全回到原式）：{{math:1}}

body.en:
Paper 2 is multiple choice: you do not need the full written solution — but you do not have to expand everything either. In many factorisation MC questions, the signs of the last two terms eliminate half the options at once: the tail $+m-n$ is just $+(m-n)$, so one of the two brackets must be $(m-n)$ — the other options can be deleted immediately.
Example: $4m^{2}-7mn+3n^{2}+m-n$: {{math:0}}
After deleting, still verify once by expanding the answer back to the original expression: {{math:1}}

body.zh:
卷二的四項題幾乎都是同一條路：分組 → 每組抽公因式 → 兩個括號要一樣。
例：$2xy-xz+4y^{2}-2yz$，分組後兩組都是 $(2y-z)$：{{math:0}}
如果分組後括號差一個負號，把 $-1$ 抽出來就一樣：{{math:1}}
如果兩組完全配不上，就調位（把有共同括號的兩項拉在一起）再試。六項題同理：三項一組、抽三次，通常會出現同一個括號。

body.en:
Almost every four-term question in Paper 2 follows one route: group → factor each pair → make the brackets identical.
Example: $2xy-xz+4y^{2}-2yz$ — after grouping, both brackets are $(2y-z)$: {{math:0}}
If the brackets differ by a sign, take out $-1$: {{math:1}}
If they do not match at all, rearrange the terms (pull together the two that share a bracket) and try again. Six terms work the same way: group into threes and the same bracket usually appears.

The tail of (b) can always be written as a multiple of (a)'s bracket. Three common cases:
(1) factor a positive number: $+9a+18b=9(a+2b)$;
(2) reversed order → factor out a minus: $-m+2n=-(m-2n)$, $-20r+16s=-4(5r-4s)$;
(3) higher degree → factor out the lowest power first: $a^{4}+a^{3}-12a^{2}=a^{2}(a^{2}+a-12)$.
Example with three parts: {{math:0}}
Now substitute (a)'s answer and take the shared bracket out: {{math:1}}
Once the bracket matches (a), the last step is simply to take it out.

body.zh:
卷一 4 分題的模式固定：(a) 先抽公因式，(b) 的三項剛好就是 (a) 的負數或倍數。
例：$x^{3}+x^{2}y+5x^{2}=x^{2}(x+y+5)$，而 (b) 的尾巴 $-x-y-5=-(x+y+5)$：{{math:0}}
抽出共同括號之後，餘下的通常是 $x^{2}-1$、$x^{2}-9$、$x^{2}-16$ —— 全部可以再用平方差：{{math:1}}
所以「completely」的意思是：抽完括號之後，仍要檢查餘下那塊能否再分解。

body.en:
The 4-mark pattern never changes: (a) factors out, and (b)'s remaining terms are exactly a multiple of (a).
Example: $x^{3}+x^{2}y+5x^{2}=x^{2}(x+y+5)$ while (b)'s tail $-x-y-5=-(x+y+5)$: {{math:0}}
After the shared bracket is taken out, what remains is usually $x^{2}-1$, $x^{2}-9$ or $x^{2}-16$ — all of which split further: {{math:1}}
So 'completely' means: after factoring the bracket, check whether the remainder can still be factorized.

body.zh:
(a)(b)(c) 型：(a) 與 (b) 各自簡單，兩者都藏著「同一條括號」，(c) 把兩塊拼起來再抽走那條括號：{{math:0}}
(平方 − 平方) 型（HKDSE 2022 Paper 1 Q4）：(a) 先做完全平方 $81c^{2}-18c+1=(9c-1)^{2}$，(b) 把後面三項整組抽負號，就變成 $a^{2}-b^{2}$：{{math:1}}
最後要檢查每個括號能否再抽公因式，例如 $(10x+5y-5)=5(2x+y-1)$；本例 $(19c-d-1)$ 與 $(c-d+1)$ 都沒有，所以已經分解完全。

body.en:
(a)(b)(c) type: (a) and (b) are simple and both hide the same bracket; (c) joins the two pieces and factors that bracket out: {{math:0}}
(square $-$ square) type (HKDSE 2022 Paper 1 Q4): (a) makes a perfect square $81c^{2}-18c+1=(9c-1)^{2}$, then (b) takes a minus out of the last three terms, giving $a^{2}-b^{2}$: {{math:1}}
Finally check every bracket for a remaining common factor, e.g. $(10x+5y-5)=5(2x+y-1)$; here neither $(19c-d-1)$ nor $(c-d+1)$ has one, so the factorisation is complete.

There is more than one way to solve a quadratic equation — factorisation, the quadratic formula, completing the square, or cancelling when both sides share the same factor. This lesson focuses on the three most useful:
(1) factorisation (find the roots with the calculator, then work back to the factors) — no need to force the cross-method;
(2) a factor on both sides: take it $=0$ first for one root, then cancel it for the other root;
(3) the quadratic formula $x=\frac{-b\pm\sqrt{b^{2}-4ac}}{2a}$ — for surd roots or awkward coefficients.
Method 1 (calculator factorisation): on a Casio fx-50FH II press [FMLA 01] (or run Prog 1 on a fx-3650P II) and enter $a$, $b$, $c$ to get the two roots. Reverse rule: a fraction root $x=\frac{p}{q}$ gives the factor $(qx-p)$; an integer root $x=k$ gives $(x-k)$:
{{math:0}}
Method 2 (a factor on both sides): split it into two cases and no root is lost —
(a) first assume that common factor $=0$: it always satisfies the equation (both sides become 0), so you get one root straight away;
(b) for everything else (the factor is $\ne 0$), you may cancel it and solve the remaining linear equation — that gives the other root.
✗ Wrong (cancelling $x$ without splitting the cases): this leaves only $x=-8$ and loses $x=0${{math:1}}
✓ Right (split the cases first): {{math:2}}
Example: solve $(x-2t)(x-3t)=(6t-x)(x-3t)$ — take $(x-3t)=0$ to get $x=3t$; in the other case cancel $(x-3t)$ to get $2x-8t=0$, i.e. $x=4t$ — both roots kept.
(Moving everything to one side and factoring gives exactly the same roots; both routes are acceptable, so use whichever you are steadier at.)
Method 3 (quadratic formula): use it when factorisation is not clean (surd roots): {{math:3}}
Finally: whichever method you use, always write every root (both sides of “or”).

body.zh:
卷二最愛考這種題：已知一個根，要求另一條式子的值 —— 做法通常是兩步：① 寫下 $a\alpha^{2}+b\alpha+c=0$；② 把方程整理成「$\alpha^{2}=$（一條含有 $\alpha$ 的式子）」，再整塊代入目標式：那個式子是分數也可以 —— 分子整塊乘，約簡時每一項都要除。
例：已知 $\alpha$ 是方程 $x^{2}-4x-2=0$ 的一個根，求 $3+8\alpha-2\alpha^{2}$ 的值。{{math:0}}
不需要求出 $\alpha$ 的數值（它通常是無理數）；用「根」這個關係就夠。
另一個例子：已知 $\beta$ 是方程 $3\beta^{2}-5\beta-7=0$ 的一個根，求 $4+10\beta-6\beta^{2}$ 的值。{{math:1}}

body.en:
A Paper 2 favourite: given one root, find the value of another expression — usually two steps: (1) write down $a\alpha^{2}+b\alpha+c=0$; (2) rearrange the equation into $\alpha^{2}=$ (an expression in $\alpha$), then substitute that whole expression into the target; a fraction is fine — multiply the whole numerator, and divide every term when cancelling.
Example: given that $\alpha$ is a root of $x^{2}-4x-2=0$, find the value of $3+8\alpha-2\alpha^{2}$. {{math:0}}
You do not need the value of $\alpha$ itself (it is usually irrational); the root relation is enough.
Another example: given that $\beta$ is a root of $3\beta^{2}-5\beta-7=0$, find the value of $4+10\beta-6\beta^{2}$. {{math:1}}

